      "speaker_role": "family_member",
      "transcript_text": "Amlodipine, 5 mg, once a day. And omeprazole, 20 mg, in the mornings.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:27",
      "end_timestamp": "02:34",
      "supports": [
        "medications[0]",
        "medications[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Thanks. And the amlodipine is for your high blood pressure, is that right?",
